{"route":"/rajokri/services-interior-design-services","city":"rajokri","nested":false,"meta":{"og":{"type":"website","site_name":"9th-Corner","title":"Interior Design Services in Rajokri | 9th Corner","description":"Complete interior design services in Rajokri by 9th Corner: space planning, 3D views, custom furniture and on-site work for every room.","url":"https://www.ninthcorner.in/rajokri/services-interior-design-services","image":"https://www.ninthcorner.in/img/og-default.jpg","image:width":"1200","image:height":"630"},"twitter":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"Interior Design Services in Rajokri | 9th Corner","description":"Complete interior design services in Rajokri by 9th Corner: space planning, 3D views, custom furniture and on-site work for every room.","image":"https://www.ninthcorner.in/img/og-default.jpg"},"title":"Interior Design Services in Rajokri | 9th Corner","robots":"index, follow","author":"9th-Corner","publisher":"9th-Corner","google-site-verification":"bFDxjFr1uDW3hEQ7YEzagKY9ZLzkrW1k1vtMcyQahyE","description":"Complete interior design services in Rajokri by 9th Corner: space planning, 3D views, custom furniture and on-site work for every room.","keywords":"Interior Design Services in Rajokri, Best interior design services in Rajokri, Affordable interior design services in Rajokri, Luxury interior design services in Rajokri, Home interior design services in Rajokri, Commercial interior design services in Rajokri, Residential interior services in Rajokri, Office interior design services in Rajokri, Modular kitchen interior services in Rajokri, Modern interior design services in Rajokri, Budget-friendly interior designers in Rajokri, Interior decorators in Rajokri, Top interior design companies in Rajokri, Interior designers for small flats in Rajokri, Professional interior design services in Rajokri, Turnkey interior design services in Rajokri, 3BHK interior design services in Rajokri, Villa interior design services in Rajokri,","theme-color":"#0f141f","canonical":"https://www.ninthcorner.in/rajokri/services-interior-design-services"},"jsonLd":["{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"LocalBusiness\",\"@id\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/#organization\",\"name\":\"9th Corner\",\"alternateName\":[\"Ninth Corner\",\"9th-Corner\"],\"url\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/\",\"image\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/img/logo.avif\",\"logo\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/img/logo.avif\",\"description\":\"Our interior design services in Rajokri are tailored to transform your spaces into elegant, functional, and personalized environments. We believe that every interior should reflect the personality of its occupants while maintaining perfect harmony between aesthetics and utility.\",\"telephone\":\"+91-9310582834\",\"email\":\"ninthcorner83@gmail.com\",\"priceRange\":\"$$$\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"Pearls Best Heights I, 808, Netaji Subhash Place, Pitampura\",\"addressLocality\":\"Delhi\",\"postalCode\":\"110034\",\"addressRegion\":\"Delhi\",\"addressCountry\":\"IN\"},\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"City\",\"name\":\"Rajokri\"},\"sameAs\":[\"https://www.facebook.com/ninthcornerINC\",\"https://www.instagram.com/9thcorner.interiors/\",\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/9th-corner-int/\",\"https://youtube.com/@9thcorner\"]}","{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Rajokri\",\"item\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/rajokri/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Interior Design Services in Rajokri\",\"item\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/rajokri/services-interior-design-services\"}]}","{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"@id\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/#website\",\"name\":\"9th Corner\",\"alternateName\":\"Ninth Corner\",\"url\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/#organization\"}}","{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What interior design services do you offer in Rajokri?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Space planning, concept design, 3D views, working drawings, material and furniture selection, lighting and site supervision for farmhouses, homes and commercial spaces.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can you design guest houses and staff quarters?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Guest houses, staff quarters and service areas are planned along with the main house so the whole property works smoothly.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you work on event venues?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. We design banquet halls, lawns and event spaces with flexible layouts, lighting and durable finishes.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Why choose end-to-end interior design services for a farmhouse?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"A farmhouse has many buildings and outdoor areas. One team handling design and supervision keeps the style and quality consistent.\"}}]}","{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"Interior Design Services in Rajokri, Delhi\",\"serviceType\":\"Interior Design Services\",\"description\":\"Complete interior design services in Rajokri by 9th Corner: space planning, 3D views, custom furniture and on-site work for every room.\",\"url\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/rajokri/services-interior-design-services\",\"provider\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/#organization\"},\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"Rajokri, Delhi\"}}"],"preloads":[],"html":"<!-- CITY-EXPANSION -->\n    <style>\n        /* New Warm & Elegant Theme Colors */\n        :root {\n            --bg-color: #f4f1ee; /* Warm Off-White */\n            --text-color: #5a5349; /* Warm Gray/Brown Body Text */\n            --heading-color: #4a433a; /* Darker Warm Gray/Brown Headings */\n            --accent-color: #8b8173; /* Muted Khaki/Taupe Accent */\n            --font-serif: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;\n            --font-sans: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;\n\n            /* Existing non-color variables kept for structure */\n            --shadow-subtle: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n            --border-radius: 12px;\n        }\n\n        /* General Styles */\n        body {\n            font-family: var(--font-sans);\n            background-color: var(--bg-color);\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .container {\n            width: 100%;\n            padding: 0 20px;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n        h1, h2, h3 {\n            font-family: var(--font-serif);\n            font-weight: 700;\n            line-height: 1.1;\n            margin-top: 0;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        p {\n            font-weight: 400;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n        }\n        b, strong {\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        section {\n            padding: 60px 0;\n        }\n        \n        /* --- Hero Section --- */\n        .hero-section {\n            background-image: url('/img/cos5.avif'); \n            background-size: cover;\n            background-position: center center;\n            position: relative; \n            overflow: hidden;\n            min-height: 400px;\n            color: var(--bg-color);\n            padding: 80px 20px 60px;\n            border-bottom-left-radius: 40px;\n            border-bottom-right-radius: 40px;\n            text-align: center;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            z-index: 1;\n        }\n        \n        .hero-section::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            bottom: 0;\n            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n            z-index: 2;\n        }\n        \n        .hero-section .container {\n            position: relative;\n            z-index: 3;\n        }\n\n        .hero-section h1 {\n            font-size: clamp(30px, 5.5vw, 54px);\n            font-weight: 700;\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n            color: var(--bg-color);\n            text-shadow: none;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Content & Philosophy --- */\n        .content-wrap {\n            padding: 40px 0;\n            max-width: 1400px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n        .intro-text, .philosophy-box {\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .intro-text h2 {\n            font-size: clamp(26px, 3.5vw, 36px);\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n            line-height: 1.25;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box {\n            background-color: var(--bg-color);\n            border: 2px solid var(--accent-color);\n            padding: 30px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .philosophy-box p {\n            font-style: italic;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box p:last-child {\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Services Grid --- */\n        .services-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n            gap: 30px;\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .service-card.full-width,\n        .service-card:nth-child(3),\n        .service-card:nth-child(4) {\n            grid-column: 1 / -1;\n        }\n        .service-card {\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            padding: 30px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;\n        }\n        .service-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-5px);\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);\n        }\n        .service-card h3 {\n            font-size: 24px;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .service-card p {\n            font-size: 15px;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        .service-card p:last-child {\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n        }\n        .service-card ul {\n            padding-left: 20px;\n            margin: 10px 0;\n        }\n        .service-card li {\n            font-size: 15px;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            margin-bottom: 6px;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n        }\n\n        /* --- Why Choose Us --- */\n        .why-choose-us {\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .why-choose-us h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .why-choose-intro {\n            text-align: center;\n            max-width: 800px;\n            margin: 0 auto 30px;\n            font-size: 16px;\n        }\n        .why-choose-intro p {\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        .reason-list {\n            list-style: none;\n            padding: 0;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));\n            gap: 20px;\n        }\n        .reason-list li {\n            background: #ffffff;\n            padding: 20px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            border-left: 5px solid var(--accent-color);\n            font-size: 15px;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n        }\n        .reason-list strong {\n            display: block;\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .final-cta-message {\n            margin-top: 30px;\n            text-align: center;\n            font-style: italic;\n            font-size: 15px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .final-cta-message a {\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n            text-decoration: underline;\n            font-weight: 600;\n        }\n\n        /* --- FAQ Section --- */\n        .faq-section {\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .faq-section h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .faq-list {\n            max-width: 900px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n        .faq-item {\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            padding: 20px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .faq-q {\n            font-size: 18px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        .faq-a {\n            font-size: 15px;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            margin: 0;\n        }\n\n        /* Learn More Button */\n        .learn-more-wrap {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-top: 35px;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n        .learn-more-btn {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: var(--accent-color);\n            color: #ffffff;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            padding: 14px 38px;\n            border-radius: 30px;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(139, 129, 115, 0.3);\n            letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n        }\n        .learn-more-btn:hover {\n            background-color: var(--heading-color);\n            color: #ffffff;\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(74, 67, 58, 0.4);\n        }\n\n        /* --- Closing Section --- */\n        .closing-section {\n            padding: 40px;\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n            margin-top: 30px;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .closing-section h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .closing-section p {\n            max-width: 900px;\n            margin: 0 auto 15px;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            line-height: 1.7;\n        }\n        .closing-section p a {\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n            font-weight: 600;\n            text-decoration: underline;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Work Done / Project Showcase Gallery Carousel --- */\n        .work-gallery-section {\n            margin-top: 50px;\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n        .gallery-header {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 35px;\n            padding: 0 20px;\n        }\n        .gallery-header h2 {\n            font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 36px);\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-header p {\n            font-size: 16px;\n            max-width: 750px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper {\n            width: 100%;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            position: relative;\n            padding: 15px 0 25px;\n            -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 4%, black 96%, transparent);\n            mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 4%, black 96%, transparent);\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-track {\n            display: flex;\n            width: max-content;\n            animation: infiniteGalleryScroll 30s linear infinite;\n            will-change: transform;\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper:hover .gallery-carousel-track,\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper:active .gallery-carousel-track {\n            animation-play-state: paused;\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-group {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 25px;\n            padding-right: 25px;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n        .gallery-card {\n            width: 320px;\n            max-width: 340px;\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            overflow: hidden;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(139, 129, 115, 0.2);\n            transition: transform 0.35s ease, box-shadow 0.35s ease, border-color 0.35s ease;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n        .gallery-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-8px);\n            box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);\n            border-color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-img-wrap {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 240px;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            position: relative;\n            background-color: #e5e0d8;\n            border-radius: inherit;\n        }\n        .gallery-img-wrap img {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            object-fit: cover;\n            display: block;\n            transition: transform 0.6s ease;\n        }\n        .gallery-card:hover .gallery-img-wrap img {\n            transform: scale(1.08);\n        }\n        @keyframes infiniteGalleryScroll {\n            0% {\n                transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);\n            }\n            100% {\n                transform: translate3d(-25%, 0, 0);\n            }\n        }\n        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n            .gallery-carousel-track {\n                animation: none;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-wrapper {\n                overflow-x: auto;\n                -webkit-mask-image: none;\n                mask-image: none;\n            }\n        }        /* Mobile Responsiveness */\n        @media (max-width: 767px) {\n            .hero-section {\n                padding: 60px 16px 40px;\n                border-radius: 0;\n            }\n            .content-wrap.container {\n                padding-left: 0;\n                padding-right: 0;\n                padding-top: 25px;\n                padding-bottom: 25px;\n            }\n            .intro-text {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                max-width: 100%;\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                margin-bottom: 35px;\n            }\n            .intro-text h2 {\n                font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 6.5vw, 2.1rem);\n                line-height: 1.22;\n                margin-bottom: 16px;\n            }\n            .intro-text p {\n                font-size: 16px;\n                line-height: 1.7;\n                margin-bottom: 15px;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                max-width: 100%;\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                padding: 26px 16px;\n                border-radius: 16px;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                overflow: hidden;\n                margin-bottom: 40px;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box h2 {\n                margin: 0 0 22px;\n                text-align: center;\n                font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 7vw, 2.25rem);\n                line-height: 1.18;\n                overflow-wrap: break-word;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box p {\n                width: 100%;\n                margin: 0 0 20px;\n                padding: 0;\n                text-align: left;\n                text-indent: 0;\n                font-size: 17px;\n                line-height: 1.7;\n                overflow-wrap: break-word;\n                word-break: normal;\n                hyphens: none;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box p:last-child {\n                margin-bottom: 0;\n            }\n            .services-grid {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n                gap: 20px;\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                margin-bottom: 40px;\n            }\n            .why-choose-us,\n            .faq-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n            }\n            .gallery-card {\n                width: 280px;\n            }\n            .gallery-img-wrap {\n                height: 200px;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-group {\n                gap: 18px;\n                padding-right: 18px;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-track {\n                animation-duration: 22s;\n            }\n            .closing-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                padding: 25px 16px;\n                border-radius: 16px;\n            }\n            .process-card-row {\n                flex-direction: column;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (min-width: 481px) and (max-width: 767px) {\n            .intro-text,\n            .philosophy-box,\n            .services-grid,\n            .why-choose-us,\n            .faq-section,\n            .closing-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 40px);\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n\n    <!-- HERO SECTION -->\n    <section class=\"hero-section\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h1>Interior Design Services in Rajokri, Delhi</h1>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- MAIN CONTENT WRAPPER -->\n    <div class=\"container content-wrap\">\n\n        <!-- INTRO -->\n        <div class=\"intro-text\">\n            <h2>Interiors for Every Kind of Property in Rajokri</h2>\n            <p>Our interior design services in Rajokri, Delhi cover residential, commercial, and luxury spaces with a focus on unmatched quality. We provide complete solutions from initial conceptualization to final execution, ensuring every project is visually stunning, functional, and deeply personalized. Our services include master space planning, bespoke material selection, custom furniture design, and professional project management.</p>\n            <p>Our interior design services in Rajokri cover village homes, new rental floors, guest houses, farmhouses and small offices. Each comes with its own budget and goals. A rental floor needs durable finishes; a family home needs comfort and storage; a guest house near the airport needs rooms that are easy to clean and quick to turn around.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- PHILOSOPHY / SERVICE OVERVIEW -->\n        <div class=\"philosophy-box\">\n            <h2>Tailored Designs for Every Space</h2>\n            <p>\"We take a holistic approach, combining artistic creativity with structural practicality. By understanding your specific lifestyle or brand requirements, we craft interiors that are not only aesthetically pleasing but also sustainable, enhancing the long-term comfort, usability, and value of your property.\"</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- SERVICE CATEGORIES GRID (4 CARDS) -->\n        <div class=\"services-grid\">\n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <h3>Homes and Rental Floors</h3>\n                <p>For owner-occupied homes, we design every room with the family's habits in mind. For rental floors, we keep designs neutral and tough: laminate wardrobes, simple modular kitchens, good lighting and easy-care floors that suit a wide range of tenants.</p><p>Both get proper planning for water heaters, AC units and inverters.</p><p>We also help owners choose taps, switches and lights that are easy to replace if a tenant damages them.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <h3>Guest Houses and Service Apartments</h3>\n                <p>With the airport so close, many properties in Rajokri and Mahipalpur serve short-stay guests. Our interior design services for these spaces focus on compact, comfortable rooms, good blackout curtains, sound insulation, hotel-style bathrooms and furniture that withstands constant use.</p><p>Keycard locks, luggage racks and simple work desks are planned for each room, along with a small reception and linen storage.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"service-card full-width\">\n                <h3>What You Can Expect From Us</h3>\n                <p>A site visit and clear brief. Layouts and 3D views before any money is spent on site. Material selection with samples. A detailed budget, room by room. Skilled carpenters, electricians and painters under one supervisor. Regular updates. A final walk-through and a list of warranties. You can choose design-only support or a full turnkey project.</p><p>For small budgets, we can phase the work: essentials first, then décor and extras when you are ready.</p><p><b>Full-Cycle Execution:</b> Our interior design services handle every phase of the project, from the first sketch to the final handover, ensuring a stress-free experience for the client.</p><p><b>Bespoke Solutions:</b> Creating customized design strategies for luxury homes, high-performance offices, and innovative commercial environments.</p><p><b>3D Visual Planning:</b> Utilizing high-end 3D visualization and meticulous space planning to ensure every inch of your interior is used efficiently.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"service-card full-width\">\n                <h3>From First Call to Handover</h3>\n                <p>We fix a visit, measure the property and understand your goals. A proposal for our interior design services follows, with scope, time and fees.</p><p>Once you agree, we finalise the design and start work with a planned schedule. You get photo updates every week and a smooth handover at the end.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- WHY CHOOSE US -->\n        <section class=\"why-choose-us\">\n            <h2>Our Interior Design Services, Matched to Your Property</h2>\n            <div class=\"why-choose-intro\">\n                <p>We match the design to the purpose of the property. That keeps spending sensible and the result fit for use. A guest house and a family home should not get the same design.</p>\n            </div>\n            <ul class=\"reason-list\">\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Professional Team with Multi-Sector Experience</strong>\n                    A team experienced with homes, rentals and guest houses.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Attention to Detail & High-Quality Finishes</strong>\n                    Neat workmanship and reliable fittings.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Seamless Management from Concept to Completion</strong>\n                    One continuous process from concept to completion.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Designs for Short-Stay Rooms</strong>\n                    Hotel-style comfort that is easy to maintain.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Weekly Photo Updates</strong>\n                    See progress even when you are away.\n                </li>\n            </ul>\n            <div class=\"final-cta-message\">\n                <p>Ready to elevate your space in Rajokri? Partner with our expert design team to create an interior that perfectly balances form and function.</p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- WORK DONE / PORTFOLIO SHOWCASE -->\n        <section class=\"work-gallery-section\">\n            <div class=\"gallery-header\">\n                <h2>Our Completed Projects Near Rajokri</h2>\n                <p>Finished homes from Saket, Gurgaon and South Extension.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"gallery-carousel-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"gallery-carousel-track\">\n                    <div class=\"gallery-carousel-group\">\n                        <div class=\"gallery-card\">\n                            <div class=\"gallery-img-wrap\">\n                                <img width=\"800\" height=\"550\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/project/mr-sachin-saket/mr-sachin-saket/18.avif\" alt=\"Interior project in Saket, Delhi by 9th Corner\" title=\"Saket Interior\">\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"gallery-card\">\n                            <div class=\"gallery-img-wrap\">\n                                <img width=\"800\" height=\"550\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/project/mr-alok-verma-south-x/mr-alok-verma-south-x/218.avif\" alt=\"Interior design in South Extension, Delhi by 9th Co