     <h3 class=\"faq-q\">Why choose end-to-end interior design services for a farmhouse?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">A farmhouse has many buildings and outdoor areas. One team handling design and supervision keeps the style and quality consistent.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- /FAQS:auto -->\n\n        <!-- CLOSING SECTION -->\n        <div class=\"closing-section\">\n            <h2>The Right Interior for the Right Purpose</h2>\n            <p>You may live in it, rent it out or host guests. Either way, good interior design services help your property work harder and look better. We plan with the end user in mind, whoever that is.</p><p>Have a property in Rajokri? <a href=\"/rajokri/contact\">Get a quote from 9th Corner</a>.</p>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n"}